From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:41:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gateway): a restart wait answers a front end's read-only
 socket verbs

gateway.restart_wait_ws_reads (false = off): during a restart's after-turn wait an interactive WebSocket may also call the read-only verbs a front end polls while it shows a chat (subagent.list, subagent.tail, subagent.roster, process.list, session.control.read, delegation.status, session.transcript, session.context_breakdown, session.active_list, commands.catalog, config.get, model.options) instead of getting runtime_draining. The hub's Activity panel showed 'Could not load activity: runtime_draining' for the whole wait, on a socket the wait keeps open. Writes are still refused.
---
